From a4f534419ec612a60f7785c811e19eee377f06c7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: letress <212964567+letress@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:39:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] dt-bindings: arm: samsung: Document Motorola One Action
 (troika)

Motorola One Action (XT2013, codename troika) is a phone based on the
Exynos9609. The 9609 is a lower-clocked Exynos9610: the chip-id
register reads the Exynos9610 product ID (0xE9610000) and the vendor
kernel treats it as an Exynos9610 throughout, so the board is listed
under the existing Exynos9610 fallback.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/arm/samsung/samsung-boards.yaml          | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/samsung/samsung-boards.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/samsung/samsung-boards.yaml
index 4564283..aae51d4 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/samsung/samsung-boards.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/samsung/samsung-boards.yaml
@@ -250,6 +250,7 @@ properties:
       - description: Exynos9610 based boards
         items:
           - enum:
+              - motorola,troika                 # Motorola One Action (XT2013)
               - samsung,gta4xl                  # Samsung Galaxy Tab S6 Lite (SM-P610/P615)
           - const: samsung,exynos9610
 
